<title>HONG KONG: China Merchants Holdings mandates $100 mln funding.</title>
<headline>China Merchants Holdings mandates $100 mln funding.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Merchants Holdings has mandated Bankers Trust, Sanwa Bank and WestLB to arrange a US$100 million financing facility via a special-purpose vehicle, bankers said.</p>
<p>The facility has a final maturity of five years. It backs a US$100 million commercial paper program.</p>
<p>    The deal is fully underwritten.    --Hong Kong Newsroom</p>
<p>(852) 2847 4039</p>
